## Notes

- The US is the base and always 1.00; there is no `usa` coefficient.
- Floors: minimum coefficient 0.35; minimum price $0.99 for premium/high-income tiers,
  $0.49 elsewhere. If the cheapest product would breach its floor, all products scale up
  together so their ratios hold.
- Prices snap to real Apple tiers, so the final price can differ by a cent or two.
- Never read, echo or copy the `.p8` key or `.env` contents.
